@title: quotes_cycle
@context: The quote changes on every click and comes round again.
@tags: network
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the quotes
    NAVIGATE to 'Quotes'
    VERIFY that 'Simple things should be simple.' is present
    VERIFY that 'Alan Kay' is present

STEP 2: The next quote
    CLICK the 'Next quote' button
    VERIFY that 'Make it work, make it right, make it fast.' is present
    VERIFY that 'Kent Beck' is present

STEP 3: Round to the first
    CLICK the 'Next quote' button
    VERIFY that 'Simple things should be simple.' is present
    VERIFY that 'Kent Beck' is NOT present

STEP 4: The second again
    CLICK the 'Next quote' button
    VERIFY that 'Kent Beck' is present

STEP 5: The first again
    CLICK the 'Next quote' button
    VERIFY that 'Alan Kay' is present

STEP 6: The second once more
    CLICK the 'Next quote' button
    VERIFY that 'Make it work, make it right, make it fast.' is present

STEP 7: Go home
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Home'

DONE.
